			"paragraphHTML": "<p>This section introduces key grammar and usage patterns for talking about nationality, origin, and languages in French. You will practise common verb groups, useful structures such as <em class='grammar-term-em'>parler</em> and <em class='grammar-term-em'>venir de</em>, and agreement patterns used in everyday communication.</p>",
